 "remarks": "Welcome to this freshly painted, sun-filled one-bedroom, one-bath penthouse in the desirable Greenwich Gate complex. The apartment features a dramatic cathedral-style vaulted ceiling, recently installed new carpeting, a versatile office nook, and a spacious kitchen with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and a breakfast bar. Enjoy the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer, central air conditioning, and forced-air heating. Step outside onto your private patio overlooking beautifully landscaped gardens - the perfect place to enjoy your morning coffee at sunrise. One outdoor parking space is included. Conveniently located just minutes from downtown Greenwich, Port Chester, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway, this inviting apartment is ready to welcome you home.",
